IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sfa-definitions-schemes`

-- Tests for sfa-definitions-schemes.
-- Expected values are written from the text of the Act (the quote lines in the module under test), never from its output.

-- (a)(i), (a)(ii)(A) and (a)(iii)(A)(AA)
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "collective investment scheme" (a) the arrangement has the characteristics in paragraph (a)` WITH `the participants do not have day-to-day control over the management of the property` IS TRUE, `the property is managed as a whole by or on behalf of a manager` IS TRUE, `the contributions of the participants, and the profits or income out of which payments are made to them, are pooled` IS FALSE, `the effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to participate in or receive profits, income, or other payments or returns from the property` IS TRUE, `the effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to receive sums paid out of such profits, income, or other payments or returns` IS FALSE, `the purpose, purported purpose or purported effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to participate in or receive profits, income, or other payments or returns from the property` IS FALSE, `the purpose, purported purpose or purported effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to receive sums paid out of such profits, income, or other payments or returns` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a)(i), (a)(ii)(B) and (a)(iii)(A)(AB)
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "collective investment scheme" (a) the arrangement has the characteristics in paragraph (a)` WITH `the participants do not have day-to-day control over the management of the property` IS TRUE, `the property is managed as a whole by or on behalf of a manager` IS FALSE, `the contributions of the participants, and the profits or income out of which payments are made to them, are pooled` IS TRUE, `the effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to participate in or receive profits, income, or other payments or returns from the property` IS FALSE, `the effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to receive sums paid out of such profits, income, or other payments or returns` IS TRUE, `the purpose, purported purpose or purported effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to participate in or receive profits, income, or other payments or returns from the property` IS FALSE, `the purpose, purported purpose or purported effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to receive sums paid out of such profits, income, or other payments or returns` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- both of (a)(ii) and (a)(iii)(B)(BA): "either or both"
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "collective investment scheme" (a) the arrangement has the characteristics in paragraph (a)` WITH `the participants do not have day-to-day control over the management of the property` IS TRUE, `the property is managed as a whole by or on behalf of a manager` IS TRUE, `the contributions of the participants, and the profits or income out of which payments are made to them, are pooled` IS TRUE, `the effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to participate in or receive profits, income, or other payments or returns from the property` IS FALSE, `the effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to receive sums paid out of such profits, income, or other payments or returns` IS FALSE, `the purpose, purported purpose or purported effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to participate in or receive profits, income, or other payments or returns from the property` IS TRUE, `the purpose, purported purpose or purported effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to receive sums paid out of such profits, income, or other payments or returns` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a)(iii)(B)(BB)
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "collective investment scheme" (a) the arrangement has the characteristics in paragraph (a)` WITH `the participants do not have day-to-day control over the management of the property` IS TRUE, `the property is managed as a whole by or on behalf of a manager` IS TRUE, `the contributions of the participants, and the profits or income out of which payments are made to them, are pooled` IS FALSE, `the effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to participate in or receive profits, income, or other payments or returns from the property` IS FALSE, `the effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to receive sums paid out of such profits, income, or other payments or returns` IS FALSE, `the purpose, purported purpose or purported effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to participate in or receive profits, income, or other payments or returns from the property` IS FALSE, `the purpose, purported purpose or purported effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to receive sums paid out of such profits, income, or other payments or returns` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a)(i) fails: the participants have day-to-day control
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "collective investment scheme" (a) the arrangement has the characteristics in paragraph (a)` WITH `the participants do not have day-to-day control over the management of the property` IS FALSE, `the property is managed as a whole by or on behalf of a manager` IS TRUE, `the contributions of the participants, and the profits or income out of which payments are made to them, are pooled` IS FALSE, `the effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to participate in or receive profits, income, or other payments or returns from the property` IS TRUE, `the effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to receive sums paid out of such profits, income, or other payments or returns` IS FALSE, `the purpose, purported purpose or purported effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to participate in or receive profits, income, or other payments or returns from the property` IS FALSE, `the purpose, purported purpose or purported effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to receive sums paid out of such profits, income, or other payments or returns` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (a)(ii) fails: neither managed as a whole nor pooled
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "collective investment scheme" (a) the arrangement has the characteristics in paragraph (a)` WITH `the participants do not have day-to-day control over the management of the property` IS TRUE, `the property is managed as a whole by or on behalf of a manager` IS FALSE, `the contributions of the participants, and the profits or income out of which payments are made to them, are pooled` IS FALSE, `the effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to participate in or receive profits, income, or other payments or returns from the property` IS TRUE, `the effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to receive sums paid out of such profits, income, or other payments or returns` IS FALSE, `the purpose, purported purpose or purported effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to participate in or receive profits, income, or other payments or returns from the property` IS FALSE, `the purpose, purported purpose or purported effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to receive sums paid out of such profits, income, or other payments or returns` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (a)(iii) fails: no profit-sharing effect or purpose
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "collective investment scheme" (a) the arrangement has the characteristics in paragraph (a)` WITH `the participants do not have day-to-day control over the management of the property` IS TRUE, `the property is managed as a whole by or on behalf of a manager` IS TRUE, `the contributions of the participants, and the profits or income out of which payments are made to them, are pooled` IS FALSE, `the effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to participate in or receive profits, income, or other payments or returns from the property` IS FALSE, `the effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to receive sums paid out of such profits, income, or other payments or returns` IS FALSE, `the purpose, purported purpose or purported effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to participate in or receive profits, income, or other payments or returns from the property` IS FALSE, `the purpose, purported purpose or purported effect of the arrangement is to enable the participants to receive sums paid out of such profits, income, or other payments or returns` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- (a): an arrangement with all the paragraph (a) characteristics and no exclusion
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "collective investment scheme" the arrangement is a collective investment scheme` WITH `the arrangement has the characteristics in paragraph (a) of the definition of collective investment scheme` IS TRUE, `the Authority has specified the arrangement, or its class or description, as a collective investment scheme by notice in the Gazette` IS FALSE, `the arrangement is operated by a person otherwise than by way of business` IS FALSE, `each participant carries on a business other than investment business and enters into the arrangement solely incidental to that other business` IS FALSE, `each of the participants is a related corporation of the manager` IS FALSE, `the arrangement is made by or on behalf of an entity solely for the benefit of its directors, former directors, consultants, advisers, employees or former employees, or those of a related corporation, and their spouses, widows, widowers and children below 18` IS FALSE, `the arrangement is made by or on behalf of 2 or more entities solely for the benefit of persons each of whom is a director, former director, consultant, adviser, employee or former employee of any of them, or of a related corporation, or the spouse, widow, widower or child below 18 of one of them` IS FALSE, `the arrangement is a franchise` IS FALSE, `the arrangement is one under which money is received by an advocate and solicitor from a client, acting in the ordinary course of practice, or by a statutory body as a stakeholder in carrying out its statutory functions` IS FALSE, `the arrangement is made by a co-operative society registered under the Co-operative Societies Act 1979 in accordance with its objects solely for the benefit of its members` IS FALSE, `the arrangement is made for the purposes of a chit fund permitted to operate under the Chit Funds Act 1971` IS FALSE, `the arrangement arises out of a life policy within the meaning of the Insurance Act 1966` IS FALSE, `the arrangement is a closed-end fund constituted as an entity, a sub-fund or a trust` IS FALSE, `the whole amount of each participant's contribution under the arrangement is a deposit as defined in section 4B of the Banking Act 1970` IS FALSE, `the predominant purpose of the arrangement is to enable the participants to share in the use or enjoyment of the property or to make its use or enjoyment available gratuitously to others` IS FALSE, `the property consists of a currency of a country or territory` IS FALSE, `the property consists of capital markets products` IS FALSE, `the property consists of a policy as defined in the First Schedule to the Insurance Act 1966` IS FALSE, `the property consists of a deposit as defined in section 4B of the Banking Act 1970` IS FALSE, `the property consists of credit facilities as defined in section 2(1) of the Banking Act 1970` IS FALSE, `the Authority has specified the arrangement, or its class or description, as not constituting a collective investment scheme by notice in the Gazette` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b): specified by the Authority as a collective investment scheme
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "collective investment scheme" the arrangement is a collective investment scheme` WITH `the arrangement has the characteristics in paragraph (a) of the definition of collective investment scheme` IS FALSE, `the Authority has specified the arrangement, or its class or description, as a collective investment scheme by notice in the Gazette` IS TRUE, `the arrangement is operated by a person otherwise than by way of business` IS FALSE, `each participant carries on a business other than investment business and enters into the arrangement solely incidental to that other business` IS FALSE, `each of the participants is a related corporation of the manager` IS FALSE, `the arrangement is made by or on behalf of an entity solely for the benefit of its directors, former directors, consultants, advisers, employees or former employees, or those of a related corporation, and their spouses, widows, widowers and children below 18` IS FALSE, `the arrangement is made by or on behalf of 2 or more entities solely for the benefit of persons each of whom is a director, former director, consultant, adviser, employee or former employee of any of them, or of a related corporation, or the spouse, widow, widower or child below 18 of one of them` IS FALSE, `the arrangement is a franchise` IS FALSE, `the arrangement is one under which money is received by an advocate and solicitor from a client, acting in the ordinary course of practice, or by a statutory body as a stakeholder in carrying out its statutory functions` IS FALSE, `the arrangement is made by a co-operative society registered under the Co-operative Societies Act 1979 in accordance with its objects solely for the benefit of its members` IS FALSE, `the arrangement is made for the purposes of a chit fund permitted to operate under the Chit Funds Act 1971` IS FALSE, `the arrangement arises out of a life policy within the meaning of the Insurance Act 1966` IS FALSE, `the arrangement is a closed-end fund constituted as an